        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This ruby-studded dawnsilver chalice can't be harmed by any substance it holds, no matter how caustic. Furthermore, liquid placed within the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chalice of Ozem",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " never spills unless its carrier chooses to do so (using a single action with the concentrate trait)."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Iomedae's Blessing",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "two"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (concentrate, manipulate)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frequency",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " once per hour"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You hold the chalice and call out Iomedae's name. The chalice casts "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "25a3d838-3162-5afd-a28e-bccf51fbd742"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " with a +19 modifier to its counteract check."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Destruction",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " If the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chalice of Ozem",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is filled with Iomedae's blood and Arazni drinks from it, it shatters."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
